From 0a115277960eb7bbc533fbd2362e3cf83e1ee21f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joonhoekim <26rote@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 01:29:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 39/56] pmic5-gen4-adc: mailing-list series (squashed)

  [PATCH 1/7] dt-bindings: iio: adc: Add support for QCOM PMIC5 Gen4 ADC
  [PATCH 2/7] iio: adc: qcom-spmi-adc5-gen3: Add support for QCOM PMIC5 Gen4 ADC
  [PATCH 3/7] thermal: qcom: qcom-spmi-adc-tm5-gen3: Add support for QCOM PMIC5 Gen4 ADC
  [PATCH 4/7] arm64: dts: qcom: Add header file for ADC5 Gen4 channel macros
  [PATCH 5/7] arm64: dts: qcom: pmk8850: Add ADC5 Gen4 peripheral
  [PATCH 6/7] arm64: dts: qcom: glymur: Add ADC support for Glymur CRD
  [PATCH 7/7] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali: Add ADC support for Kaanapali boards

First author: Jishnu Prakash <jishnu.prakash@oss.qualcomm.com>

[rebased onto 7.3: applied on top of the 7.3 ADC_TM5 gen3 (0024 merged upstream); glymur-crd.dtsi hunks left out (only fuzz-3 matches, board unrelated); kaanapali-mtp/qrd hunks offset]
